hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1194","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman aadmi ka haq nahi hai jiskey paas kuchh ho jiskey baarey mein wo wasiyat karey ke wo do raatein guzaarey magar uski wasiyat uskey paas likhi hui ho. (Bukhari: 2738)"
"1195","[AI-translation] Amr bin Haaris se riwayat hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key hum-zulf aur Juwairiya bint Haaris (Raziallahu anha) key bhai hain, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni maut key waqt dirham aur na deenaar aur na ghulaam aur na londi aur na kuchh chhoda. Magar apna safed khachchar aur apna hathiyaar aur zameen jo Aap ne sadqa kar di thi. (Bukhari: 2739)"
"1196","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Aufa (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se poochha gaya: Kya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wasiyat ki thi? To unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. To un se kaha gaya: Logon par wasiyat kaisey likhi gai ya unhey wasiyat ka hukm kaisey diya gaya? Unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne Allah ki Kitaab ki wasiyat ki thi. (Bukhari: 2740)"
"1197","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaunsa sadqa afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ye ke tum sadqa karo jabke tum tandrust aur harees ho, maal-daari ki ummeed rakhtey ho aur faqr se dartey ho. Aur mohlat na do yahan tak ke jab (jaan) halq tak pahunchay to kaho: Fulaan key liye itna aur fulaan key liye itna, jabke wo fulaan ka ho chuka hai. (Bukhari: 2748)"
"1198","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey jab Allah ne naazil farmaya: (Aur apne qareebi rishtedaaron ko daraao). Aap ne farmaya: Ae Quraish ki jamaat! Ya us jaisa kalimat. Apne aap ko khareed lo, main tumharey liye Allah ki taraf se kuchh kaam na aaunga. Ae Bani Abd Manaaf! Main tumharey liye Allah ki taraf se kuchh kaam na aaunga. Ae Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib! Main tumharey liye Allah ki taraf se kuchh kaam na aaunga. Aur ae Safiya jo Rasulullah ki phuphi hain! Main tumharey liye Allah ki taraf se kuchh kaam na aaungi. Aur ae Faatima bint Muhammad! Merey maal mein se jo chaaaho maango, main tumharey liye Allah ki taraf se kuchh kaam na aaungi. (Bukhari: 2753)"
"1199","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein apna maal sadqa kya jabke use Samgh kaha jaata tha aur wo khajoor tha. To Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main ne maal paaya hai aur wo merey paas qeemti hai. To main ne chaaha ke main use sadqa karun. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Uski jad sadqa karo, na becha jaeyga aur na tohfey mein diya jaaeyga aur na wiraasat mein liya jaaeyga. Lekin uska phal kharch kya jaaeyga. To Umar ne use sadqa kar diya. To uska wo sadqa Allah key raastey mein aur gardanon mein aur miskeenon aur mehmaan aur musaafir aur rishtedaar key liye hai. Aur jo uska wali ho us par gunaah nahi hai ke wo us mein se dastoor key mutaabiq khaey ya apne dost ko khilaaey baghair uskey sath maal jama kiye. (Bukhari: 2764)"
"1200","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Saath halaak karney waliyon se bacho. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur wo kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Allah key sath shirk karna. Aur jaadu. Aur jaan ko qatl karna jisey Allah ne haraam kya hai magar haq key sath. Aur sood khaana. Aur yateem ka maal khaana. Aur ladai key din peeth morna. Aur paakdaaman momin ghaafil auraton par tohmat lagaana. (Bukhari: 2767)"
"1201","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Merey waaris deenaar aur dirham taqseem na karengey. Jo main ne apni biwiyon key kharch aur apne kaam karney waley key saamaan key baad chhoda wo sadqa hai. (Bukhari: 2776)"
"1202","[AI-translation] Usmaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne gheraao key waqt kaha: Main tumhey Allah ka waasta deta hun aur main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba key siwa kisi ko waasta nahi deta. Kya tum nahi jaantey ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Rooma (kuwaan) khodey uskey liye Jannat hai. To main ne use khoda? Kya tum nahi jaantey ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo Usrat key lashkar ko tayyaar karey uskey liye Jannat hai. To main ne unhey tayyaar kya? To unhon-ne usey jo us ne kaha tha sachcha kaha."
"1203","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Bani Sahm mein se aik aadmi Tameem Daari aur Adi bin Baddaa key sath nikla. To Sahmi aisi zameen mein mara jahaan Musalman na tha. Phir jab wo donon uska tarka ley kar aey to soney se naqsh chaandi ka pyaala gum paaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un donon se qasam li. Phir pyaala Makkah mein paaya gaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne use Tameem aur Adi se khareeda hai. To uskey waliyon mein se do aadmi khadey huey aur unhon-ne qasam khai ke hamaari gawahi un donon ki gawahi se zyada haq hai aur beshak pyaala unkey saathi ka hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur unkey baarey mein ye aayat naazil hui: (Ae imaan walon! Tumhaarey darmiyaan gawahi jab tum mein se kisi ko maut aaey). (Bukhari: 2780). Jihaad aur seerat ki kitaab."
